  <para style="h">1 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 thiSalanIkinaH patraM</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 thiSalanIkinaH</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 thiSalanIkinaH</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 thiSalanIkinaH patraM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>paulaH silvAnastImathiyazca piturIzvarasya prabho ryIzukhrISTasya cAzrayaM prAptA thiSalanIkIyasamitiM prati patraM likhanti| asmAkaM tAta IzvaraH prabhu ryIzukhrISTazca yuSmAn pratyanugrahaM zAntiJca kriyAstAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>vayaM sarvveSAM yuSmAkaM kRte IzvaraM dhanyaM vadAmaH prArthanAsamaye yuSmAkaM nAmoccArayAmaH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>asmAkaM tAtasyezvarasya sAkSAt prabhau yIzukhrISTe yuSmAkaM vizvAsena yat kAryyaM premnA yaH parizramaH pratyAzayA ca yA titikSA jAyate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tat sarvvaM nirantaraM smarAmazca| he piyabhrAtaraH, yUyam IzvareNAbhirucitA lokA iti vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yato'smAkaM susaMvAdaH kevalazabdena yuSmAn na pravizya zaktyA pavitreNAtmanA mahotsAhena ca yuSmAn prAvizat| vayantu yuSmAkaM kRte yuSmanmadhye kIdRzA abhavAma tad yuSmAbhi rjJAyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yUyamapi bahuklezabhogena pavitreNAtmanA dattenAnandena ca vAkyaM gRhItvAsmAkaM prabhozcAnugAmino'bhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tena mAkidaniyAkhAyAdezayo ryAvanto vizvAsino lokAH santi yUyaM teSAM sarvveSAM nidarzanasvarUpA jAtAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yato yuSmattaH pratinAditayA prabho rvANyA mAkidaniyAkhAyAdezau vyAptau kevalametannahi kintvIzvare yuSmAkaM yo vizvAsastasya vArttA sarvvatrAzrAvi, tasmAt tatra vAkyakathanam asmAkaM niSprayojanaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yato yuSmanmadhye vayaM kIdRzaM pravezaM prAptA yUyaJca kathaM pratimA vihAyezvaraM pratyAvarttadhvam amaraM satyamIzvaraM sevituM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>mRtagaNamadhyAcca tenotthApitasya putrasyArthata AgAmikrodhAd asmAkaM nistArayitu ryIzoH svargAd AgamanaM pratIkSitum Arabhadhvam etat sarvvaM te lokAH svayam asmAn jJApayanti|</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, yuSmanmadhye 'smAkaM pravezo niSphalo na jAta iti yUyaM svayaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>aparaM yuSmAbhi ryathAzrAvi tathA pUrvvaM philipInagare kliSTA ninditAzca santo'pi vayam IzvarAd utsAhaM labdhvA bahuyatnena yuSmAn Izvarasya susaMvAdam abodhayAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yato'smAkam Adezo bhrAnterazucibhAvAd votpannaH pravaJcanAyukto vA na bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>kintvIzvareNAsmAn parIkSya vizvasanIyAn mattvA ca yadvat susaMvAdo'smAsu samArpyata tadvad vayaM mAnavebhyo na rurociSamANAH kintvasmadantaHkaraNAnAM parIkSakAyezvarAya rurociSamANA bhASAmahe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>vayaM kadApi stutivAdino nAbhavAmeti yUyaM jAnItha kadApi chalavastreNa lobhaM nAcchAdayAmetyasmin IzvaraH sAkSI vidyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>vayaM khrISTasya preritA iva gauravAnvitA bhavitum azakSyAma kintu yuSmattaH parasmAd vA kasmAdapi mAnavAd gauravaM na lipsamAnA yuSmanmadhye mRdubhAvA bhUtvAvarttAmahi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yathA kAcinmAtA svakIyazizUn pAlayati tathA vayamapi yuSmAn kAGkSamANA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yuSmabhyaM kevalam Izvarasya susaMvAdaM tannahi kintu svakIyaprANAn api dAtuM manobhirabhyalaSAma, yato yUyam asmAkaM snehapAtrANyabhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, asmAkaM zramaH kleेzazca yuSmAbhiH smaryyate yuSmAkaM ko'pi yad bhAragrasto na bhavet tadarthaM vayaM divAnizaM parizrAmyanto yuSmanmadhya Izvarasya susaMvAdamaghoSayAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>aparaJca vizvAsino yuSmAn prati vayaM kIdRk pavitratvayathArthatvanirdoSatvAcAriNo'bhavAmetyasmin Izvaro yUyaJca sAkSiNa Adhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>aparaJca yadvat pitA svabAlakAn tadvad vayaM yuSmAkam ekaikaM janam upadiSTavantaH sAntvitavantazca,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>ya IzvaraH svIyarAjyAya vibhavAya ca yuSmAn AhUtavAn tadupayuktAcaraNAya yuSmAn pravarttitavantazceti yUyaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yasmin samaye yUyam asmAkaM mukhAd IzvareNa pratizrutaM vAkyam alabhadhvaM tasmin samaye tat mAnuSANAM vAkyaM na mattvezvarasya vAkyaM mattvA gRhItavanta iti kAraNAd vayaM nirantaram IzvaraM dhanyaM vadAmaH, yatastad Izvarasya vAkyam iti satyaM vizvAsinAM yuSmAkaM madhye tasya guNaH prakAzate ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, khrISTAzritavatya Izvarasya yAH samityo yihUdAdeze santi yUyaM tAsAm anukAriNo'bhavata, tadbhuktA lokAzca yadvad yihUdilokebhyastadvad yUyamapi svajAtIyalokebhyo duHkham alabhadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>te yihUdIyAH prabhuM yIzuM bhaviSyadvAdinazca hatavanto 'smAn dUrIkRtavantazca, ta IzvarAya na rocante sarvveSAM mAnavAnAM vipakSA bhavanti ca;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>aparaM bhinnajAtIyalokAnAM paritrANArthaM teSAM madhye susaMvAdaghoSaNAd asmAn pratiSedhanti cetthaM svIyapApAnAM parimANam uttarottaraM pUrayanti, kintu teSAm antakArI krodhastAn upakramate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH manasA nahi kintu vadanena kiyatkAlaM yuSmatto 'smAkaM vicchede jAte vayaM yuSmAkaM mukhAni draSTum atyAkAGkSayA bahu yatitavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>dvirekakRtvo vA yuSmatsamIpagamanAyAsmAkaM vizeSataH paulasya mamAbhilASo'bhavat kintu zayatAno 'smAn nivAritavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>yato'smAkaM kA pratyAzA ko vAnandaH kiM vA zlAghyakirITaM? asmAkaM prabho ryIzukhrISTasyAgamanakAle tatsammukhasthA yUyaM kiM tanna bhaviSyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yUyam evAsmAkaM gauravAnandasvarUpA bhavatha|</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>ato'haM yadA sandehaM punaH soDhuM nAzaknuvaM tadAnIm AthInInagara ekAkI sthAtuM nizcitya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>svabhrAtaraM khrISTasya susaMvAde sahakAriNaJcezvarasya paricArakaM tImathiyaM yuSmatsamIpam apreSayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>varttamAnaiH klezaiH kasyApi cAJcalyaM yathA na jAyate tathA te tvayA sthirIkriyantAM svakIyadharmmamadhi samAzvAsyantAJceti tam AdizaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>vayametAdRze kleेze niyuktA Asmaha iti yUyaM svayaM jAnItha, yato'smAkaM durgati rbhaviSyatIti vayaM yuSmAkaM samIpe sthitikAle'pi yuSmAn abodhayAma, tAdRzameva cAbhavat tadapi jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tasmAt parIkSakeNa yuSmAsu parIkSiteSvasmAkaM parizramo viphalo bhaviSyatIti bhayaM soDhuM yadAhaM nAzaknuvaM tadA yuSmAkaM vizvAsasya tattvAvadhAraNAya tam apreSayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintvadhunA tImathiyo yuSmatsamIpAd asmatsannidhim Agatya yuSmAkaM vizvAsapremaNI adhyasmAn suvArttAM jJApitavAn vayaJca yathA yuSmAn smarAmastathA yUyamapyasmAn sarvvadA praNayena smaratha draSTum AkAGkSadhve ceti kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, vArttAmimAM prApya yuSmAnadhi vizeSato yuSmAkaM klezaduHkhAnyadhi yuSmAkaM vizvAsAd asmAkaM sAntvanAjAyata;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yato yUyaM yadi prabhAvavatiSThatha tarhyanena vayam adhunA jIvAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>vayaJcAsmadIyezvarasya sAkSAd yuSmatto jAtena yenAnandena praphullA bhavAmastasya kRtsnasyAnandasya yogyarUpeNezvaraM dhanyaM vadituM kathaM zakSyAmaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>vayaM yena yuSmAkaM vadanAni draSTuM yuSmAkaM vizvAse yad asiddhaM vidyate tat siddhIkarttuJca zakSyAmastAdRzaM varaM divAnizaM prArthayAmahe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>asmAkaM tAtenezvareNa prabhunA yIzukhrISTena ca yuSmatsamIpagamanAyAsmAkaM panthA sugamaH kriyatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>parasparaM sarvvAMzca prati yuSmAkaM prema yuSmAn prati cAsmAkaM prema prabhunA varddhyatAM bahuphalaM kriyatAJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>aparamasmAkaM prabhu ryIzukhrISTaH svakIyaiH sarvvaiH pavitralokaiH sArddhaM yadAgamiSyati tadA yUyaM yathAsmAkaM tAtasyezvarasya sammukhe pavitratayA nirdoSA bhaviSyatha tathA yuSmAkaM manAMsi sthirIkriyantAM|</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, yuSmAbhiH kIdRg AcaritavyaM IzvarAya rocitavyaJca tadadhyasmatto yA zikSA labdhA tadanusArAt punaratizayaM yatnaH kriyatAmiti vayaM prabhuyIzunA yuSmAn vinIyAdizAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yato vayaM prabhuyIzunA kIdRzIrAjJA yuSmAsu samarpitavantastad yUyaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>IzvarasyAyam abhilASo yad yuSmAkaM pavitratA bhavet, yUyaM vyabhicArAd dUre tiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yuSmAkam ekaiko janaH svakIyaM prANAdhAraM pavitraM mAnyaJca rakSatu,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ye ca bhinnajAtIyA lokA IzvaraM na jAnanti ta iva tat kAmAbhilASasyAdhInaM na karotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>etasmin viSaye ko'pyatyAcArI bhUtvA svabhrAtaraM na vaJcayatu yato'smAbhiH pUrvvaM yathoktaM pramANIkRtaJca tathaiva prabhuretAdRzAnAM karmmaNAM samucitaM phalaM dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yasmAd Izvaro'smAn azucitAyai nAhUtavAn kintu pavitratvAyaivAhUtavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>ato heto ryaH kazcid vAkyametanna gRhlAti sa manuSyam avajAnAtIti nahi yena svakIyAtmA yuSmadantare samarpitastam Izvaram evAvajAnAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>bhrAtRSu premakaraNamadhi yuSmAn prati mama likhanaM niSprayojanaM yato yUyaM parasparaM premakaraNAyezvarazikSitA lokA Adhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kRtsne mAkidaniyAdeze ca yAvanto bhrAtaraH santi tAn sarvvAn prati yuSmAbhistat prema prakAzyate tathApi he bhrAtaraH, vayaM yuSmAn vinayAmahe yUyaM puna rbahutaraM prema prakAzayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>aparaM ye bahiHsthitAsteSAM dRSTigocare yuSmAkam AcaraNaM yat manoramyaM bhavet kasyApi vastunazcAbhAvo yuSmAkaM yanna bhavet,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>etadarthaM yUyam asmatto yAdRzam AdezaM prAptavantastAdRzaM nirvirodhAcAraM karttuM svasvakarmmaNi manAMmi nidhAtuM nijakaraizca kAryyaM sAdhayituM yatadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH nirAzA anye lokA iva yUyaM yanna zocedhvaM tadarthaM mahAnidrAgatAn lokAnadhi yuSmAkam ajJAnatA mayA nAbhilaSyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yIzu rmRtavAn punaruthitavAMzceti yadi vayaM vizvAsamastarhi yIzum AzritAn mahAnidrAprAptAn lokAnapIzvaro'vazyaM tena sArddham AneSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yato'haM prabho rvAkyena yuSmAn idaM jJApayAmi; asmAkaM madhye ye janAH prabhorAgamanaM yAvat jIvanto'vazekSyante te mahAnidritAnAm agragAminona na bhaviSyanti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>yataH prabhuH siMhanAdena pradhAnasvargadUtasyoccaiH zabdenezvarIyatUrIvAdyena ca svayaM svargAd avarokSyati tena khrISTAzritA mRtalokAH prathamam utthAsyAnti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>aparam asmAkaM madhye ye jIvanto'vazekSyante ta AkAze prabhoH sAkSAtkaraNArthaM taiH sArddhaM meghavAhanena hariSyante; itthaJca vayaM sarvvadA prabhunA sArddhaM sthAsyAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ato yUyam etAbhiH kathAbhiH parasparaM sAntvayata|</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, kAlAn samayAMzcAdhi yuSmAn prati mama likhanaM niSprayojanaM,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yato rAtrau yAdRk taskarastAdRk prabho rdinam upasthAsyatIti yUyaM svayameva samyag jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>zAnti rnirvvinghatvaJca vidyata iti yadA mAnavA vadiSyanti tadA prasavavedanA yadvad garbbhinIm upatiSThati tadvad akasmAd vinAzastAn upasthAsyati tairuddhAro na lapsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>kintu he bhrAtaraH, yUyam andhakAreNAvRtA na bhavatha tasmAt taddinaM taskara iva yuSmAn na prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>sarvve yUyaM dIpteH santAnA divAyAzca santAnA bhavatha vayaM nizAvaMzAstimiravaMzA vA na bhavAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>ato 'pare yathA nidrAgatAH santi tadvad asmAbhi rna bhavitavyaM kintu jAgaritavyaM sacetanaizca bhavitavyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>ye nidrAnti te nizAyAmeva nidrAnti te ca mattA bhavanti te rajanyAmeva mattA bhavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>kintu vayaM divasasya vaMzA bhavAmaH; ato 'smAbhi rvakSasi pratyayapremarUpaM kavacaM zirasi ca paritrANAzArUpaM zirastraM paridhAya sacetanai rbhavitavyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yata Izvaro'smAn krodhe na niyujyAsmAkaM prabhunA yIzukhrISTena paritrANasyAdhikAre niyuुktavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>jAgrato nidrAgatA vA vayaM yat tena prabhunA saha jIvAmastadarthaM so'smAkaM kRte prANAn tyaktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ataeva yUyaM yadvat kurutha tadvat parasparaM sAntvayata susthirIkurudhvaJca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, yuSmAkaM madhye ye janAH parizramaM kurvvanti prabho rnAmnA yuSmAn adhitiSThantyupadizanti ca tAn yUyaM sammanyadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>svakarmmahetunA ca premnA tAn atIvAdRyadhvamiti mama prArthanA, yUyaM parasparaM nirvvirodhA bhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, yuSmAn vinayAmahe yUyam avihitAcAriNo lokAn bhartsayadhvaM, kSudramanasaH sAntvayata, durbbalAn upakuruta, sarvvAn prati sahiSNavo bhavata ca|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>aparaM kamapi pratyaniSTasya phalam aniSTaM kenApi yanna kriyeta tadarthaM sAvadhAnA bhavata, kintu parasparaM sarvvAn mAnavAMzca prati nityaM hitAcAriNo bhavata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>sarvvadAnandata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>nirantaraM prArthanAM kurudhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sarvvaviSaye kRtajJatAM svIkurudhvaM yata etadeva khrISTayIzunA yuSmAn prati prakAzitam IzvarAbhimataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>pavitram AtmAnaM na nirvvApayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>IzvarIyAdezaM nAvajAnIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>sarvvANi parIkSya yad bhadraM tadeva dhArayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yat kimapi pAparUpaM bhavati tasmAd dUraM tiSThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>zAntidAyaka IzvaraH svayaM yuSmAn sampUrNatvena pavitrAn karotu, aparam asmatprabho ryIzukhrISTasyAgamanaM yAvad yuSmAkam AtmAnaH prANAH zarIrANi ca nikhilAni nirddoSatvena rakSyantAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yo yuSmAn Ahvayati sa vizvasanIyo'taH sa tat sAdhayiSyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>he bhrAtaraH, asmAkaM kRte prArthanAM kurudhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>pavitracumbanena sarvvAn bhrAtRn prati satkurudhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>patramidaM sarvveSAM pavitrANAM bhrAtRNAM zrutigocare yuSmAbhiH paThyatAmiti prabho rnAmnA yuSmAn zapayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>asmAkaM prabho ryIzukhrISTasyAnugrate yuSmAsu bhUyAt| Amen|</para>
</usx>
